---
// Accountability section — the core differentiator: Partner & Group modes
---

<section class="accountability section-lg" id="accountability">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-inverse">What makes TinyAct different</span>
      <h2>Two ways to put something on the line</h2>
      <p>One partner or a whole group. Either way, your streak is never yours alone — and that's the point.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="accountability-modes">
      <!-- Partner Mode -->
      <div class="mode-card reveal">
        <div class="mode-head">
          <h3>Partner mode</h3>
          <span class="mode-tag">1 : 1</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mode-desc">Pair with one accountability partner. Your streaks are linked — if one breaks, both restart at zero.</p>

        <div class="mode-visual">
          <div class="partner-visual">
            <div class="partner-user">
              <div class="avatar avatar-coral">Y</div>
              <div class="user-info">
                <span class="name">You</span>
                <span class="status">Done today</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="connection" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="connection-line"></span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path>
                <path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path>
              </svg>
              <span class="connection-line"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="partner-user">
              <div class="avatar avatar-purple">S</div>
              <div class="user-info">
                <span class="name">Sarah</span>
                <span class="status">Done today</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="streak-count">
            <span class="streak-num">21</span>
            <span class="streak-text">day streak together</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="mode-features">
          <li>If one person misses, both streaks reset</li>
          <li>Real-time notification when your partner checks in</li>
          <li>Reactions to celebrate each other</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Group Mode -->
      <div class="mode-card reveal">
        <div class="mode-head">
          <h3>Group mode</h3>
          <span class="mode-tag">3 – 8</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mode-desc">Up to 8 people, one shared commitment. Turn on "All Accountable" — one person misses, everyone's streak resets.</p>

        <div class="mode-visual">
          <div class="group-visual">
            <div class="group-avatars">
              <div class="avatar avatar-coral">Y</div>
              <div class="avatar avatar-green">M</div>
              <div class="avatar avatar-purple">J</div>
              <div class="avatar avatar-blue">K</div>
              <div class="avatar avatar-more">+2</div>
            </div>
            <div class="group-name">Morning Workout Crew</div>
            <div class="group-status">
              <span class="status-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              4 of 6 checked in today
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="streak-count">
            <span class="streak-num">14</span>
            <span class="streak-text">day group streak</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="mode-features">
          <li>Teams of 3–8 for maximum accountability</li>
          <li>Optional "All Members Accountable" mode</li>
          <li>Live activity feed inside the group</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="psychology-callout reveal">
      <p>
        <span class="callout-figure">65%</span> more likely to reach a goal when you commit
        to another person — <span class="callout-figure">95%</span> with regular accountability
        check-ins. TinyAct automates both, with real consequences for missing.
      </p>
      <span class="callout-source">American Society of Training &amp; Development</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .accountability {
    background: var(--night);
    color: var(--ink-inverse);
  }

  .accountability .section-header h2 {
    color: var(--ink-inverse);
  }

  .accountability .section-header p {
    color: var(--ink-inverse-soft);
  }

  .accountability-modes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .mode-card {
    background: var(--night-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--night-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-8);
  }

  .mode-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .mode-head h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--ink-inverse);
  }

  .mode-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--coral);
    border: 1px solid var(--night-line);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .mode-desc {
    color: var(--ink-inverse-soft);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .mode-visual {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    border: 1px solid var(--night-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .partner-visual {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .partner-user {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .avatar {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: #fff;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .avatar-coral { background: var(--coral); }
  .avatar-green { background: var(--green); }
  .avatar-purple { background: var(--purple); }
  .avatar-blue { background: #3B82F6; }
  .avatar-more {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--night-line);
    color: var(--ink-inverse-soft);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
  }

  .user-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .user-info .name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .user-info .status {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .connection {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--coral);
    flex: 1;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .connection-line {
    height: 1.5px;
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 40px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--coral) 0 5px, transparent 5px 10px);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .streak-count {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--night-line);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .streak-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--coral);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .streak-text {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-inverse-soft);
  }

  .group-visual {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .group-avatars {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .group-avatars .avatar {
    margin-right: -8px;
    border: 2px solid var(--night-2);
  }

  .group-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .group-status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-inverse-soft);
  }

  .status-indicator {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green);
  }

  .mode-features li {
    position: relative;
    padding: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-2) var(--space-6);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-inverse-soft);
  }

  .mode-features li::before {
    content: '✓';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--green);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .psychology-callout {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--night-line);
    padding-top: var(--space-10);
  }

  .psychology-callout p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.375rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink-inverse);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .callout-figure {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--coral);
  }

  .callout-source {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-inverse-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .accountability-modes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
